# WinPE and Windows media are the owner's property: never committed (the licences do not allow redistribution).
# This directory holds only scripts and notes; every kind of file the scripts read or write is ignored here, in any sub-directory.
# (The repository .gitignore covers some of these too; this file is meant to be enough on its own.)
*.iso
*.raw
*.img
*.efi
*.hd
*.wim
*.esd
*.swm
*.sdi
*.vhd
*.vhdx
*.qcow2
*.dd
*.ppm
*.png
*.dump
*.mem
BCD
BCD.*
bootmgr
bootmgr.*
bootx64.efi
bootia32.efi
bootaa64.efi
boot.sdi
winload.*
# the work directories of import-winpe.sh (WINPE_WORK pointed into the tree) and a media tree copied next to the scripts
work/
out/
media/
stage.*/
shots/
dumps/
